    accept = "You wear the guise of Judgment, $C. I see it shine under the light of your faith, yet it seems rather dim. Perhaps the one you carry is not suited for the tasks you are willing to perform.$B$B<Geldra hums for a few seconds.>$B$BHand it here and tell me, what sins do you seek to judge?",
